	(descr "EFM8BB51 QFN20 3x3 mm, pitch 0.5, corner pins 1/6/11/16, EP 1.8 mm with 4 in-pad vias 0.35/0.20 (Type VII). Land = EFM8BB51 data sheet Rev 1.0 Table 7.2 p56; paste per note 8 (2x2 x 0.75 on 0.95). https://www.silabs.com/documents/public/data-sheets/efm8bb51-datasheet.pdf | V4 (D95): EFM8BB51 ESC MCU: EP land 1.80 -> 0.90 holding 1 board GND via-in-pad (GND also on pins 3/12, ~10 mW); the 4 footprint via pads of the base are dropped, paste 0.62 (47 %); unused P0.0 2, P1.6 7, P0.7 15, P0.6 16 removed")
